{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1fe15abbe456f18b","name":"Mu-2 Long Range Shuttle","source":{"id":"source:reference-1fe15abbe456f18b","title":"Mu-2 Long Range Shuttle","revision":21390,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:42:41Z","sha256":"e94aeca411cbbedc7afebb5ab09933b651c02c0f36ae0dcdb5cbb9358886507d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21390","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mu-2%20Long%20Range%20Shuttle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1fe15abbe456f18b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Based upon the success of the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Lambda"]},"-Class Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lambda-Class_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:09ed6c8fc42f5b4e"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Theta"]},"-Class Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Theta-Class_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:c14102e9aa3e2509"},", Sienar Fleet Systems designs the Mu-2 Shuttle for long-range applications, particularly scouting and espionage. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," uses the Mu-2 Shuttle extensively as a scouting vessel searching for the remote, uncharted worlds where ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," establishes its bases. The exterior design of the Mu-2 Long Range Shuttle owes a great deal to its forebears, using two fold-out lower stabilizer wings for maneuverability, although the central fin is replaced by a series of sensor arrays to allow the crew to better perform reconnaissance duties. The cockpit is significantly redesigned to allow for a smaller crew.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Mu-2 comes in two models. Modell has limited sleeping space for crew but provides seating for up to 24 passengers, making it best suited to short-range journeys. Model 2 better fulfills the needs of a scouting mission, including enclosed cabins and space for food stores. Because of its versatility, the Mu-2 Shuttle is used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}," for years after the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},". Its ability to ferry large groups to distant points makes it an ideal choice for outpost duty as well as exploration.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Mu-2 Long Range Shuttle's sensors provide the system operator a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Sensors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Sensors","referenceId":"reference:1bf2e88f5409e504"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mu-2 Long Range Shuttle Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["